 "titulo": "1/21 Patch Details (Completed) (Compensation Distributed)",
 "fecha": 1737442817976,
 "modificada": 1740283340991,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1830042",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/39459a175a9c4b0bbbc99637c32378d7_1730183358082_d.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">This patch introduces a hero known as the Ruler of Limbo, returning with immense new power.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Her power and appearance are unlike anything seen before</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">—almost as if they’ve crossed over from a different, extraordinary dimension.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Magik</span>, the wielder of the Soul Sword and a range of unique abilities, </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">now has Tier-4 advancement and a new Uniform.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated hero</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by downloading the 1/21 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 1/21 Patch Details</span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 1/22 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 1/21 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">[1/22 (Wed) 2:48&nbsp;(UTC+0), 1/21 (Tue) 18:48 (PST) added]</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">The patch has been completed as of 1/22 (Wed) 2:48&nbsp;(UTC+0), 1/21 (Tue) 18:48&nbsp;(PST).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ One New Uniform</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">A new Uniform, Magik &lt;Marvel Rivals&gt; has been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects of the Uniform are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The two new Uniforms will be on sale for</span></span> <span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">40% off during the &lt;Marvel Rivals Collaboration Event&gt;</span></span></span> <span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1737105040909\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/070292990e0246faa5ec767b00c2c30d_1737105040909_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Magik Tier-4</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Tier-4 advancement has been updated to the superpowered mutant Magik, who draws power from the demonic realm of Limbo.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1737104494270\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/680b2a32a1d04508b3ee66ed563a7902_1737104494270_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">1. The issue where the drop rate&nbsp;for Comic Cards from Dispatch Missions was incorrectly applied during the implementation of the Dispatch Mission Sector 14 Released! Craft Event on 12/25/2024 has been fixed. </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8\">- We apologize for the inconvenience this may have caused and will be providing compensation for all Agents after the patch. Details will be updated through this notice once it is distributed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">[Compensation]</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">- Premium Comic Card Chest x1</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">- 6★ Comic Card Chest x3</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">[1/22 (Wed) 2:58&nbsp;(UTC+0), 1/21 (Tue) 18:58 (PST) added]</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Compensation has been distributed to all Agents.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">* Compensation can be received until 1/25 (Sat) 14:59 (UTC+0) and 1/25 (Sat) 6:59 (PST).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">2. The issue where the Thai localization for the Challenge “Defeat Black Swan 5 times” required to unlock World Boss: Legend+ &lt;Corvus &amp; Proxima&gt; was missing has been fixed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">We look forward to your active participation in the events that will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Thank you.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736755673723\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6a037d4f77984101834c58302b43dd94_1736755673723_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}